' For listening: v1.2's map music, scene by scene, long enough to hear
' (`preset classic ai none seed 3 start 30 music remaster map_music N`, N 0
' None, 1 Keep, 2 List; about 60 frames a second). The world map 15 s,
' Paradise Camp 8 s, its tent (the room's song) 12 s, the camp again 8 s,
' Options (the radio) 8 s, the camp 8 s, the world map 10 s.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
wait 900                 ' the world map
mapclick 110,122         ' Paradise Camp
wait 480
mapclick 177,150         ' the tent: its song
wait 720
esc                      ' the camp again
wait 480
press o                  ' Options: the radio
wait 480
press escape             ' the camp
wait 480
esc                      ' the world map
wait 600
quit
